A whole bunch of hints about the use of Unicorn Horns have been posted here,
but I haven't seen anyone mention what I believe to be the BEST use of a
unicorn horn.  So, for those who are interested...

*** Spolier Alert ***

Ever notice how when you become "weak", your strength drops by one?  Well,
apply that unicorn horn of yours at this point (possibly multiple times before
it works - as mentioned previously) and get that strength point back!  THEN,
eat some food, and viola!  Gain ANOTHER strength point for a net gain of 1
strength point!  If you eat a lump of Royal Jelly, you get a net gain of 2
strength points!  This actually makes rings of hunger and those not
particularly nutritious foods really useful.  By wandering around on the
borderline between hungry and weak with a bunch of tripe rations or fortune
cookies or the like, you can up your strength quite quickly!

Happy Hacking!

